IMPORTANT NOTICE:

This software is a clean-room reimplementation of the Bully game engine.
It does NOT include any original game assets, code, or copyrighted materials
from Rockstar Games or Take-Two Interactive.

To use this software, you MUST own a legal copy of Bully and provide your
own game data files. This project does not and will not distribute any
copyrighted game assets.

This reimplementation is created for:
- Preservation of video game history
- Interoperability and platform support
- Educational purposes
- Enabling community modifications

All reverse engineering was performed for interoperability purposes in
accordance with applicable copyright law.
